# The Promise (windurst 78): the reply kinds of sections 1 and 2 at Port Windurst (no script there: only another
# quest's line shows a kind). Level 5, Wild Card completed; Truth, Justice, and the Onion Way! accepted by GM (an Event
# line on every brigade member: Kohlo-Lakolo 371, Gomada-Vulmada 373, Papo-Hopo 372, Pichichi 374, Pyo Nzon 375,
# Shanruru 377, Yafa Yaa 376). An Event line of this quest ties with that line (one talk plays each); a Progress line
# plays on its talk.
# - Section 1: fame 324, rank 8: 505 ties; rank 9: 535 ties; fame 325: 532 (Progress), begun at Prog 0.
# - Section 2, rank 9, Prog 0: Kohlo-Lakolo 533 ties; the late lines 528, 525, 527, 526, Pichichi's 530 and Shanruru's
#   529 tie. Prog 1 by GM, rank 9: 543 ties. Rank 8: 514 ties; the in-time lines 518, 515, 517, 516 tie. The sticker by
#   GM: 522 (Progress), completed. Accepted again by GM, Prog 1, rank 9, the sticker: 542 (Progress), completed.
#   Accepted again, Prog 0, the sticker: 534 (Progress), completed. Available again by GM, rank 8: 513 (Progress), begun.
